#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:2
msgid "Contribute to this documentation"
msgstr "이 문서에 기여하기"

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:4
msgid ""
"Mattermost has a diverse community that extends well beyond code "
"contributions. If you're interested in contributing to Mattermost, why "
"not help improve the documentation? Be sure to join the documentation "
"community in `DWG: Documentation Working Group "
"<https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/dwg-documentation-"
"working-group>`_ so we can support and celebrate you!"
msgstr ""
"Mattermost에는 코드 기여를 훨씬 넘어서는 다양한 커뮤니티가 있습니다. Mattermost에 "
"기여하고 싶다면 문서 개선을 도와 보는 건 어떨까요? `DWG: Documentation Working "
"Group <https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/dwg-documentation-"
"working-group>`_ 채널의 문서 커뮤니티에 꼭 참여하세요. 여러분을 지원하고 축하해 "
"드리겠습니다!"

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:7
msgid "How to get started"
msgstr "시작하는 방법"

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:9
msgid ""
"The fastest way to get started with a documentation contribution is to "
"find something you want to change in the documentation. This might be a "
"typo or broken link, or something more extensive like revising or "
"expanding content. Once you've found a page you want to update, select "
"the edit option |edit-on-github| located in the top right corner of that "
"page."
msgstr ""
"문서 기여를 시작하는 가장 빠른 방법은 문서에서 바꾸고 싶은 부분을 찾는 것입니다. "
"오타나 깨진 링크일 수도 있고, 내용을 다듬거나 보완하는 더 큰 작업일 수도 있습니다. "
"수정할 페이지를 찾았다면 해당 페이지 오른쪽 위에 있는 |edit-on-github| 편집 "
"옵션을 선택하세요."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:115
msgid ""
"Contribute to Mattermost documentation by selecting the Edit option "
"located in the top right corner of any documentation page."
msgstr ""
"문서 페이지 오른쪽 위의 편집 옵션을 선택하여 Mattermost 문서에 기여하세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:12
msgid "First-time contributor?"
msgstr "처음 기여하시나요?"

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:14
msgid ""
"Start by exploring the `Contribute to Mattermost "
"<https://mattermost.com/contribute/>`_ documentation, specifically the "
"`\"You want to help with content\" "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/contribute/why-contribute/#you-want-"
"to-help-with-content>`_ section."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost에 기여하기 <https://mattermost.com/contribute/>`_ 문서, 특히 "
"`\"You want to help with content\" "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/contribute/why-contribute/#you-want-"
"to-help-with-content>`_ 섹션부터 살펴보세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:16
msgid ""
"In a GitHub pull request, you can make changes as if you were editing "
"code. If you're new to contributing to documentation using pull requests "
"in GitHub, the following `video "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V8ROl9wiHr8>`_ will help you get "
"started:"
msgstr ""
"GitHub 풀 리퀘스트에서는 코드를 수정하듯 문서를 변경할 수 있습니다. GitHub 풀 "
"리퀘스트로 문서에 기여하는 것이 처음이라면 다음 `동영상 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V8ROl9wiHr8>`_\\ 이 시작에 도움이 됩니다:"

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:25
msgid "Where to find more information"
msgstr "더 많은 정보를 찾는 곳"

