"<https://community.mattermost.com/core/channels/dwg-documentation-"
"working-group>`_ 채널로 문의하세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:37
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "자주 묻는 질문"

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:40
