#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:56
msgid ""
"Can contributors add themselves to the Mattermost company page on "
"LinkedIn?"
msgstr ""
"기여자가 LinkedIn의 Mattermost 회사 페이지에 자신을 추가할 수 있나요?"

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:58
msgid ""
"Yes! If you have contributed to the Mattermost project we think you "
"should be recognized for it professionally beyond GitHub."
msgstr ""
"네! Mattermost 프로젝트에 기여했다면 GitHub를 넘어 전문적으로도 인정받아야 "
"한다고 생각합니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:60
msgid ""
"To add yourself to the `Mattermost page on LinkedIn "
"<https://www.linkedin.com/company/mattermost/>`__, do the following:"
msgstr ""
"`LinkedIn의 Mattermost 페이지 "
"<https://www.linkedin.com/company/mattermost/>`__\\ 에 자신을 추가하려면 다음과 "
"같이 하세요:"

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:62
msgid "Log in to `LinkedIn <https://www.linkedin.com/>`__ or create an account."
msgstr "`LinkedIn <https://www.linkedin.com/>`__\\ 에 로그인하거나 계정을 만듭니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:63
msgid "Go to **Me > View profile**."
msgstr "**Me > View profile**\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:64
msgid ""
"Under **Experience**, select the **plus** symbol and specify the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"**Experience**\\ 에서 **plus** 기호를 선택하고 다음을 입력합니다:"

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:66
msgid "**Title**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:68
msgid ""
"Enter **Developer** if you contributed code to the open source project or"
" created a plugin, integration, or other enhancement."
msgstr ""
"오픈 소스 프로젝트에 코드를 기여했거나 플러그인, 통합 또는 기타 개선 사항을 "
"만들었다면 **Developer**\\ 를 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:69
msgid ""
"Enter **Contributor** if you've contributed without writing code (e.g., "
"filed bug report, answered troubleshooting questions, proposed a feature,"
" etc.)."
msgstr ""
"코드를 작성하지 않고 기여했다면(예: 버그 신고, 문제 해결 답변, 기능 제안 등) "
"**Contributor**\\ 를 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:70
msgid ""
"Enter **Translator** if you've `helped translate "
"<https://translate.mattermost.com>`__ Mattermost products."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost 제품 `번역에 참여 <https://translate.mattermost.com>`__\\ 했다면 "
"**Translator**\\ 를 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:71
msgid "Enter **QA Tester** if you tested Mattermost features or workflows."
msgstr "Mattermost 기능이나 워크플로를 테스트했다면 **QA Tester**\\ 를 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:72
msgid ""
"Enter **Documentation** if you contributed to Mattermost product, "
"repository, or developer documentation."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost 제품, 리포지터리 또는 개발자 문서에 기여했다면 **Documentation**\\ 을 "
"입력합니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:74
msgid "**Company**: Find **Mattermost** (you’ll see the Mattermost logo)."
msgstr "**Company**: **Mattermost**\\ 를 찾습니다(Mattermost 로고가 보입니다)."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:75
msgid "**Location**: Enter where you live."
msgstr "**Location**: 거주 지역을 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:76
msgid ""
"**From**: Date of first contribution or perhaps month you cloned "
"`github.com/mattermost`."
msgstr ""
"**From**: 첫 기여 날짜 또는 `github.com/mattermost`\\ 를 클론한 달을 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:77
msgid "Select **I currently work here**."
msgstr "**I currently work here**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:78
msgid "**Update my industry**: Leave unchecked."
msgstr "**Update my industry**: 선택하지 않은 채로 둡니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:79
msgid "**Update my headline**: Leave unchecked."
msgstr "**Update my headline**: 선택하지 않은 채로 둡니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/contribute-to-documentation.rst:80
msgid ""
"**Description**: Leave blank or write a sentence about what you have "
"contributed."
msgstr ""
"**Description**: 비워 두거나 기여한 내용을 한 문장으로 적습니다."

